25: // numUnavailableNodesReportMax represents the maximum number of unavailable
26: // nodes that should be reported on ServerStatus call. The intent is not to be
27: // exhaustive when listing them as reporting all unavailable nodes might
28: // clutter in certain cases.
29: // Reporting up to 10 unavailable nodes is probably reasonable.
30: const numUnavailableNodesReportMax = 10
